  "description": "Companion package of Gtk.Windows.Forms. Additions to the System.Windows.Forms surface that are deliberately not part of the real WinForms API, kept out of the core library so it stays a faithful compatibility layer. Ships AutoClosingMessageBox, a message box that dismisses itself after a timeout - install it with AutoClosingMessageBox.Install(timeout). Also the place to add your own extension classes over the Forms library.",
